WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.160
I feel this incredible connection with
the universe I'm part of a star

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.770
no one can show us the wonders of our
home better than those who have seen it

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:32.859
from afar

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:43.020
the space isn't vast and empty
it's no cosmic storm

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:48.160
and our planet is right in the middle of
it

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:55.000
somehow a big rock came alive

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:28.970
it's all just so wonderfully unlikely
and yet it's here

